flowchart TD
  Put["PUT or DELETE key"] --> Mem["MemTable<br/>sorted, in memory"]
  Mem -->|full| Flush["Write one sorted SSTable<br/>sequential, immutable"]
  Flush --> L0["Level 0 files<br/>key ranges overlap"]
  L0 -->|too many files| Comp["Compaction: sort-merge<br/>newest value wins"]
  Comp --> L1["Level 1 and deeper<br/>one sorted run per level"]
  Get["GET key"] --> Mem
  Mem -->|not found| Sum["Summary table and Bloom filter<br/>skip files without the key"]
  Sum --> L0
